CambonOS-Dark is based on the Default (blue) variant and Dark color scheme.
The GTK 3, GTK 4 and XFWM4 resources are selected from this pinned upstream
revision. CambonOS applies its own palette, surface policy, XFCE integration
and resource adaptations. GTK 2 is not included.

Orchis is based on Materia Theme by nana-4.
